  N=3: any fixed-precision RNN needs kD >= 6 state bits; program = 17 ops
PASS  N=3: the RNN bound follows from units 1 + 17 by arithmetic
  N=4: any fixed-precision RNN needs kD >= 7 state bits; program = 20 ops
PASS  N=4: the RNN bound follows from units 1 + 17 by arithmetic
PASS  no new construction was needed — corollaries are compositions   | Prop 1 (RNN=automaton, attained) + Thm 17 (automata need many states) = this corollary
```

